<title>INDIA: India's RBI to hold repos auction on March 1.</title>
<headline>India's RBI to hold repos auction on March 1.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India said on Thursday it will hold a three-day repos auction of government of India securities on March 1 at Bombay.</p>
<p>Bids will be accepted up to 12.30 p.m on March 1 and auction results announced the same evening, it said.</p>
<p>Payment by successful bidders will be on March 3 up to 2.30 p.m it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
